# HITL working state. The handoff artifacts ARE committed, deliberately: current-change.yaml
# anchors the change to its branch so whoever picks it up resumes from the right context
# (dev-start-change Step 7), skip-ledger.yaml is the durable cross-change ledger (CR-10), and the
# shipped first-pass CI gate reads current-change.yaml out of the checkout. Ignoring the folder
# wholesale — as this repo used to — disables handoff, the ledger, and that gate in one line.
# Only transient working files belong here:
.hitl/*.tmp
.hitl/*.migrated
.hitl/first-pass-choices.json
.hitl/backups/

# Internal / confidential — never publish to the public repo
docs/business/
docs/validation-reports/
docs/presentations/
docs/infographic/
.playwright-mcp/
